The wildfires across Western Nebraska are the worst since we became a state. They have burned over 1,000,000 acres.

Nebraska farmers and ranchers are resilient. And we’re bringing them support.

@usdaFSA is here to help. Under Secretary Fordyce and I met with Nebraska Cattlemen to share programs that provide support.

